+/**
+ * The desktop's reserve/abort/commit commands, answered by one server-scoped
+ * reservation owner over the coordinator and preparation owner the managed
+ * runtime already shares. Registered once on the shared telemetry receiver,
+ * whose reader forks each command into the server scope. A reserve first asks
+ * for the idle preparation proof the coordinator verifies under its own claim;
+ * abort and commit never start preparation. Exported only so the server test
